  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene (WASH) in Kandal province</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a two-year project which aims to increase access of rural Cambodians in Kandal Stoeung district, Kandal province to improved sanitation and to promote proper hygienic practices. The project is designed to improve hygiene through changed behaviours by promoting context-based sustainable practices in improved latrines, hand-washing with soap at critical times, drinking only safe water and environmental hygiene in 37 villages of Kandal Stoeung district.</narrative>
  </description>
